@ParkMesh_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/health

### Full 3-floor garage topology (120 bays)
GET {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/api/parking/topology

### Filter free EV bays on Floor 0
GET {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/api/parking/bays?floor=0&status=Free&vehicleType=EV

### Allocate bay for EV entering GATE-N1
POST {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/api/parking/allocations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateId": "GATE-N1",
  "vehicleSessionId": "SES-DEMO-01",
  "vehicleType": "EV",
  "leaseSeconds": 90
}

### Simulate physical intrusion on a leased bay (triggers live reroute)
POST {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/api/parking/bays/F0-B05/occupancy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occupied": true,
  "occupantSessionId": "INTRUDER-01"
}

### Active vehicle sessions
GET {{ParkMesh_HostAddress}}/api/parking/sessions
